              "diff": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>钢铁船还能装多少？</title>\n<style>\n  :root { color-scheme: light; --ink:#172d3c; --muted:#526b79; --sea:#2589a5; --sea-light:#b8e3e9; --hull:#4d5c6c; --accent:#d46a3d; --paper:#f5f8f7; }\n  * { box-sizing:border-box; }\n  body { margin:0; background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); font:16px/1.55 system-ui,-apple-system,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif; }\n  main { max-width:900px; margin:0 auto; padding:32px 20px 44px; }\n  h1 { font-size:clamp(1.8rem,5vw,2.65rem); line-height:1.15; margin:0 0 12px; letter-spacing:-.03em; }\n  .intro { color:var(--muted); max-width:690px; margin:0 0 25px; }\n  .panel { background:#fff; border:1px solid #dbe6e5; border-radius:18px; padding:20px; box-shadow:0 8px 28px #1c3c4d0b; }\n  .controls { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr auto; align-items:center; gap:8px 18px; }\n  label { font-weight:700; }\n  output { font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; font-size:1.35rem; font-weight:750; color:#a94727; }\n  input[type=range] { grid-column:1/-1; width:100%; accent-color:var(--accent); min-height:30px; cursor:pointer; }\n  input[type=range]:focus-visible { outline:3px solid #197da2; outline-offset:4px; border-radius:6px; }\n  .ends { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; color:var(--muted); font-size:.88rem; margin-top:-6px; }\n  .scene { margin:12px 0 0; }\n  svg { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; max-height:365px; }\n  .readout { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:10px; margin-top:6px; }\n  .metric { background:#f3f7f6; padding:12px 14px; border-radius:12px; }\n  .metric span { display:block; color:var(--muted); font-size:.88rem; }\n  .metric strong { display:block; font-size:1.25rem; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }\n  .status { margin:14px 0 0; padding:12px 14px; border-radius:12px; background:#e8f5f5; }\n  .status.edge { background:#fff1e7; }\n  .explain { margin:22px 2px 0; max-width:740px; }\n  .explain p { margin:9px 0; }\n  .model { font-size:.92rem; color:var(--muted); border-top:1px solid #dbe6e5; padding-top:14px; margin-top:19px; }\n  @media (max-width:560px) { main { padding:23px 14px 32px; } .panel { padding:15px; border-radius:15px; } .readout { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; } .metric:last-child { grid-column:1/-1; } }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>钢铁船还能装多少？</h1>\n  <p class=\"intro\">加货后，船会下沉一点，排开更多水，浮力随之增大，直到再次托住船和货物的总重量。拖动滑块，看看“下沉一点”怎样逐渐逼近船口。</p>\n  <section class=\"panel\" aria-label=\"钢铁船载货量示意\">\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <label for=\"cargo\">再装多少货物</label>\n      <output id=\"cargoOut\" for=\"cargo\">300 kg</output>\n      <input id=\"cargo\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1000\" step=\"10\" value=\"300\" aria-describedby=\"rangeEnds\">\n      <div class=\"ends\" id=\"rangeEnds\"><span>0 kg</span><span>1000 kg</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <figure class=\"scene\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 350\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"svgTitle svgDesc\">\n        <title id=\"svgTitle\">货物增加时船体吃水变化</title>\n        <desc id=\"svgDesc\">剖面示意图显示船体、水面和船口。载货量增加时水面相对船体升高。</desc>\n        <rect x=\"22\" y=\"40\" width=\"596\" height=\"278\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#f7fbfa\"/>\n        <line x1=\"58\" y1=\"67\" x2=\"58\" y2=\"286\" stroke=\"#78909a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        <line x1=\"52\" y1=\"67\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"67\" stroke=\"#78909a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        <line x1=\"52\" y1=\"286\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"286\" stroke=\"#78909a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        <text x=\"44\" y=\"63\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#526b79\">船口</text>\n        <text x=\"44\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#526b79\">船底</text>\n        <rect id=\"water\" x=\"72\" y=\"196\" width=\"526\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#b8e3e9\" opacity=\".72\"/>\n        <line id=\"waterline\" x1=\"72\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"598\" y2=\"196\" stroke=\"#2589a5\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n        <path d=\"M202 112 L438 112 L408 264 Q320 302 232 264 Z\" fill=\"#4d5c6c\" stroke=\"#263d4e\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n        <path d=\"M214 121 L426 121\" stroke=\"#95a5ac\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n        <g id=\"cargoStack\" fill=\"#e4a45a\" stroke=\"#915a28\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n          <rect x=\"269\" y=\"82\" width=\"48\" height=\"29\" rx=\"3\"/><rect x=\"321\" y=\"82\" width=\"48\" height=\"29\" rx=\"3\"/>\n          <rect x=\"295\" y=\"51\" width=\"48\" height=\"27\" rx=\"3\"/>\n        </g>\n        <line id=\"draftLine\" x1=\"470\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"196\" stroke=\"#a94727\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"/>\n        <text id=\"draftLabel\" x=\"479\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#873d24\">吃水 0.25 m</text>\n        <text x=\"320\" y=\"337\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#526b79\">水面升高 = 船体浸入更深</text>\n      </svg>\n    </figure>\n    <div class=\"readout\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">\n      <div class=\"metric\"><span>船和货物总质量</span><strong id=\"totalOut\">500 kg</strong></div>\n      <div class=\"metric\"><span>吃水（船底到水面）</span><strong id=\"draftOut\">0.25 m</strong></div>\n      <div class=\"metric\"><span>船口还高出水面</span><strong id=\"marginOut\">0.25 m</strong></div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"status\" id=\"status\">此时船仍有船口高出水面；静止时，浮力托住船和货物的总重量。</p>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"explain\">\n    <p><strong>为什么会下沉？</strong>货物让总重量变大。船要多排开一些水，浮力才能重新与总重量平衡，所以水线会沿船身向上移。</p>\n    <p><strong>到哪里算到边界？</strong>这个示意船的船口高出船底 0.50 m。水面到船口时，船已到达敞口进水边界；不能再把它当作稳定漂浮来算。真实船的安全载荷还取决于船体形状、稳性、波浪、货物分布等，这里没有模拟那些因素。</p>\n    <p class=\"model\">这是简化的静态模型：长方形、直立、刚性且不漏水的敞口船；忽略波浪、侧翻、变形和进水后的运动。设水密度 1000 kg/m³，船底面积 2 m²，船体自重 200 kg。吃水按 d = 总质量 ÷（水密度 × 船底面积）计算。边界总质量是 1000 kg；对应货物 800 kg。数字是教学设定，不代表真实钢铁船载重。</p>\n    <p class=\"model\">浮体平衡关系参考：<a href=\"https://farside.ph.utexas.edu/teaching/336L/Fluidhtml/node27.html\">得克萨斯大学浮体平衡讲义</a>。本页几何尺寸与数值为自拟示意。</p>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const rho = 1000, area = 2, hullMass = 200, height = 0.5;\n  const cargo = document.getElementById('cargo');\n  const cargoOut = document.getElementById('cargoOut');\n  const totalOut = document.getElementById('totalOut');\n  const draftOut = document.getElementById('draftOut');\n  const marginOut = document.getElementById('marginOut');\n  const status = document.getElementById('status');\n  const water = document.getElementById('water');\n  const waterline = document.getElementById('waterline');\n  const draftLine = document.getElementById('draftLine');\n  const draftLabel = document.getElementById('draftLabel');\n  const minY = 112, maxY = 264;\n  function update() {\n    const cargoKg = Number(cargo.value);\n    const totalKg = hullMass + cargoKg;\n    const rawDraft = totalKg / (rho * area);\n    const atOrPastEdge = rawDraft >= height;\n    const shownDraft = Math.min(rawDraft, height);\n    const y = minY + (shownDraft / height) * (maxY - minY);\n    const draftText = `${shownDraft.toFixed(2)} m`;\n    cargoOut.value = `${cargoKg} kg`;\n    cargoOut.textContent = `${cargoKg} kg`;\n    totalOut.textContent = `${totalKg} kg`;\n    draftOut.textContent = atOrPastEdge ? '到达船口' : draftText;\n    marginOut.textContent = atOrPastEdge ? '0 m' : `${(height - rawDraft).toFixed(2)} m`;\n    water.setAttribute('y', y);\n    water.setAttribute('height', 306 - y);\n    waterline.setAttribute('y1', y); waterline.setAttribute('y2', y);\n    draftLine.setAttribute('y2', y);\n    draftLabel.setAttribute('y', Math.max(132, (112 + y) / 2));\n    draftLabel.textContent = atOrPastEdge ? '水面到达船口' : `吃水 ${draftText}`;\n    status.classList.toggle('edge', atOrPastEdge);\n    if (rawDraft < height) {\n      status.textContent = '此时船仍有船口高出水面；静止时，浮力托住船和货物的总重量。';\n      document.getElementById('svgDesc').textContent = `船体吃水约${draftText}，船口仍高出水面${(height - rawDraft).toFixed(2)}米。`;\n    } else if (rawDraft === height) {\n      status.textContent = '水面刚到船口，已到达敞口进水边界；模型不再给出稳定漂浮结论。';\n      document.getElementById('svgDesc').textContent = '水面刚到船口，达到敞口进水边界。';\n    } else {\n      status.textContent = '按简化模型，所需吃水已超过船口高度；船会到达进水边界，不能再用稳定漂浮公式外推实际状态。';\n      document.getElementById('svgDesc').textContent = '计算需求超过船口高度，示意图把水线停在船口，不表示进水后的实际状态。';\n    }\n    cargo.setAttribute('aria-valuetext', `${cargoKg} 千克货物`);\n  }\n  cargo.addEventListener('input', update);\n  update();\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
            }
          ],
          "status": "completed"
        },
        {
          "type": "agentMessage",
          "id": "msg_06a4e8c9fc74bfc0016adca39fb0e88191a76a5f17b98925be",
          "text": "再装货，船的总重量增加，船身会下沉一些，排开更多水，浮力也随之增大，直到重新平衡。若水面升到敞口船的船口，就到了进水边界；真实船通常还要考虑稳性、波浪和货物分布等安全因素。\n\n我做了一个可拖动载货量的示意页：[钢铁船还能装多少？](</var/folders/5j/b8_rzdwn3219tg2qxzk54n2m0000gn/T/curiosity-eval-yjo7zmjl/curiosity-steel-ship.html>)。模型里的船口边界对应 **800 kg 货物**，这是教学设定，不是现实船舶的载重建议。页面尚未在浏览器中实际打开验证。",
          "phase": "final_answer",
